              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "A new person chooses a language and a goal, does lesson 1 as a Quick read, then signs up to keep their progress; Lesson complete offers Continue to lesson 2 right away; there is no daily gate. Log in or Skip goes to the current login screen; \"Choose your first path\" appears only after Skip, when no goal was picked. Not now continues in Guest mode. For guests the helper reads: Pick one to start. Create a free account later to unlock all 50 paths. Only these six paths are open to guests. For guests the helper reads: Pick one to start. Create a free account later to unlock all 50 paths. Only these six paths are open to guests.",
